<title>USA: Lone Star sells unit for $10.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Lone Star sells unit for $10.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lone Star Industries Inc said Thursday it had sold a unit to Prairie Material Sales Inc for $10.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said it had sold to Prairie its central Illinois ready-mixed and other concrete operations, including inventories.</p>
<p>Lone Star makes ready-mixed concrete, sand and gravel, crushed stone and other construction materials.</p>
